---
source: crates/specforge-cli/tests/extension_surfaces.rs
expression: help
---
The connected components of the see_also graph between terms (undirected), largest first, ties by first term id; terms with no see_also link are counted as isolated.

Usage: specforge product term-clusters [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --path <PATH>
          A path inside the project (the nearest directory at or above it holding specforge.json; none: the directory itself, with the default configuration)
          
          [default: .]

      --format <FORMAT>
          Output format
          
          [default: human]
          [possible values: human, json]

  -h, --help
          Print help (see a summary with '-h')
